-## Deferred work
-
-Explicitly deferred after P11-C:
-
-- IIS3DWB / SPI1 / EXTI / GPDMA;
-- MB85RS2MTA and W25Q64JV / SPI2;
-- SDMMC1 bulk storage;
-- ADM2587E / LPUART1 / DE-/RE;
-- RTC/LSE/VBAT service binding;
-- IWDG;
